WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:16.743
Raccoon: I will fly.

2
00:00:16.744 --> 00:00:22.501
I will fly to that tree!

3
00:00:22.502 --> 00:00:25.887
Owl: You can't

4
00:00:25.888 --> 00:00:34.413
fly. You do not have wings.

5
00:00:34.414 --> 00:00:37.207
I have wings.

6
00:00:37.208 --> 00:01:15.066
So I can fly. Raccoon:

7
00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:20.812
Now I have wings.

8
00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:24.066
I will fly now. Owl:

9
00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:28.633
You can't fly.

10
00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:35.616
Do not try to fly. Raccoon:

11
00:01:35.617 --> 00:01:38.522
I will fly now.

12
00:01:38.523 --> 00:01:56.958
I will fly to that tree. Raccoon:

13
00:01:56.959 --> 00:02:02.736
Oof!

14
00:02:02.737 --> 00:02:06.009
Owl: You did not fly.

15
00:02:06.010 --> 00:02:09.669
Raccoon: No, I did not

16
00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:28.837
fly. I fell.

